<p><strong><%= @name %></strong> &lt;<%= @email %>&gt; wrote through the RecoveryBot contact page.</p>
<p>Topic: <%= @topic %><br>
<% if @user %>Signed in as: <%= @user.name %> (<%= @user.email %>, @<%= @user.username %>)<% else %>Not signed in.<% end %></p>
<div style="white-space: pre-wrap; border-left: 3px solid #ccc; padding-left: 12px;"><%= @message %></div>
<p style="color: #666;">Reply to this email to answer them. <a href="<%= @admin_url %>">All contact requests</a></p>
